WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Crouching lights begin the corner knockdown.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Heavy Shoryuken completes the first combo.

3
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:03.650
Standing light kick misses while Ken is down.

4
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:04.500
Collarbone Breaker connects as Ken wakes up.

5
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Standing light punch confirms the overhead into heavy Shoryuken.

6
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:05.700
Ken falls from the separate overhead conversion.
